{"3892470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yindy", "steam_appid": 3892470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3996380, 3944480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ A horror game / walking simulator set across seven distinct maps, each with small puzzles and challenges. The maps can be accessed in any order chosen by the player, with the final goal of opening a mysterious door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.poster.avif?t=1785006384\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.webm?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.mp4?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of the character Yindy, not knowing much about her — other than the certainty that she’s just as confused as you are. Some intriguing characters may offer answers… but what can really be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.poster.avif?t=1785006384\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.webm?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.mp4?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Yindy, every decision changes the island in some way, making each playthrough unique depending on your choices. Different events are unlocked, new structures appear, new paths emerge, and many other mysteries can be discovered... or not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.poster.avif?t=1785006384\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.webm?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.mp4?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ A horror game / walking simulator set across seven distinct maps, each with small puzzles and challenges. The maps can be accessed in any order chosen by the player, with the final goal of opening a mysterious door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.poster.avif?t=1785006384\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.webm?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.mp4?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of the character Yindy, not knowing much about her — other than the certainty that she’s just as confused as you are. Some intriguing characters may offer answers… but what can really be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.poster.avif?t=1785006384\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.webm?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.mp4?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Yindy, every decision changes the island in some way, making each playthrough unique depending on your choices. Different events are unlocked, new structures appear, new paths emerge, and many other mysteries can be discovered... or not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.poster.avif?t=1785006384\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.webm?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.mp4?t=1785006384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A non-linear horror game: carry items, solve puzzles, enjoy the music, explore unique atmospheres in each map, and savor your time walking through a mysterious, dark, and intriguing world...", "supported_languages": "Portuguese - Brazil<str